Pre-battle interface oracle hook for JA2 Stracciatella (Strategy First SFI-SCLA), ja2-node 2026-10-16. See LICENSE (SFI-SCLA).
Moves the encounter-code block of InitPreBattleInterface into DeterminePersistentEncounterCode (same code, same call
site) and appends OracleDeterminePersistentEncounterCode, which runs WakeUpAllMercsInSectorUnderAttack and that block
headless for the pbi probe of src/game/Oracle.cc. Applied by tools/oracle/build.sh after 0004.

